    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Sky-Threaded)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“Lightning likes you. It thinks you’re funny.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Stormskin.</strong> You have resistance to energy damage (lightning), and you can’t be deafened by thunder.</p>\n        <p><strong>Pressure Sense.</strong> You always know when dangerous weather is imminent in your region (minutes to hours), even indoors.</p>",
